{"version":"2.2.0","protocol":"silk/2","created":"2026-10-08T14:46:12Z","notes":"Silk 2.2 works with any agent. `silk setup` adds Silk to every agent installed on your computer: Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Grok Build, Muse Code, VS Code, Windsurf, Claude Desktop, opencode, Cline, Copilot CLI, Kiro and LM Studio. `silk mcp --http --tunnel` connects cloud agents (grok.com, Grok Bot, Meta Muse, OpenAI Dots, ChatGPT, claude.ai) with an OAuth sign-in and a pairing code; your keys stay on your computer. Agents with a shell can follow https://silk-relay.vercel.app/skill.md. Security: `silk request --json` no longer prints a contact request's handshake secrets.","files":{"darwin-amd64":{"url":"https://oi226z5shjre3byg.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/silk/v2.2-X7KmxWkTOmePmQNIIpq1cr9zRSL47A.0/silk-darwin-amd64","sha256":"c1d5b08431d109bee285d531baa07402f2674ec0d04f3ab8ba884f5cbdeed460","size":7819504},"darwin-arm64":{"url":"https://oi226z5shjre3byg.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/silk/v2.2-CRE4DZXU9GHH8StDZloTAeHIC3XL2v.0/silk-darwin-arm64","sha256":"b7a3c59e850ee4c8c4fcb2afca200748b782ec604f07245b25bc5a036155f5c4","size":7265154},"linux-amd64":{"url":"https://oi226z5shjre3byg.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/silk/v2.2-GBdLDbtVpy6x5D4FUy3MpV2VthVXpM.0/silk-linux-amd64","sha256":"f40536544bacc9935ef3ec0ebcafa58a1c9879625f944c29e7e60181d49dcfb9","size":7667874},"linux-arm64":{"url":"https://oi226z5shjre3byg.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/silk/v2.2-Q3l5LJJYEqTmt9j1r0HM8VCl9aWGy8.0/silk-linux-arm64","sha256":"b45ca1e7ed121ca26363e9ac2ded4d938ea2c5494334c33d0422d814c59b6ffe","size":7078050},"relay-darwin-amd64":{"url":"https://oi226z5shjre3byg.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/silk/v2.2-f3EES72updY1wULRO0VckY01ibvsfx.0/silk-relay-darwin-amd64","sha256":"86826119e9d2c2f2f370d0899b6e97bb5f89282d6d5f9fb0af94addf9860eaa4","size":12951408},"relay-darwin-arm64":{"url":"https://oi226z5shjre3byg.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/silk/v2.2-UGqfng8wZ5soBBZYLRUnqsdsCi4QR7.0/silk-relay-dar